          "message": {
            "text": "Clock-wipe polygons use root-viewBox pixel coordinates, so the clip explicitly selects the SVG view-box geometry box. The attached failing artifact already proved the numeric center and corners were correct; binding their reference box removes WebKit's content-bounds-dependent offset and crop without changing the polygon math.",
            "markdown": "Clock-wipe polygons use root-viewBox pixel coordinates, so the clip explicitly selects the SVG view-box geometry box. The attached failing artifact already proved the numeric center and corners were correct; binding their reference box removes WebKit's content-bounds-dependent offset and crop without changing the polygon math."
          },
